[6.729882, "o", "  archetype     \u001b[36mfullstack\u001b[0m\r\n  language      python / next\r\n  contract gate block\r\n  files written 32\r\n  specs         9 skeleton(s) -> specs/  (fill via /ack-spec)\r\n  CLAUDE.md     spec-first pointer written\r\n  telemetry     2 file(s)\r\n"]
